<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>華童患瘋症</title><title type="alternate">Hua tong huan feng zheng [A Chinese Child Sent to Hospital]</title><author>無署名（《東華報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.1.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.1.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華報</title><date when="1925-08-08">1925-08-08</date><idno>Tung Wah Times, 1925-08-08, p. 7, NLA news-page24101237</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24101237">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="7" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24101237/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="7" facs="#original-page" /><head>華童患瘋症</head><p><lb n="single-1" />有壹華童年方十二歲。。於壹年前來<lb n="single-2" />澳留學。。寓於雪梨埠沙厘希燈威關<lb n="single-3" />處。。前數月間。。身體不適。。延醫調<lb n="single-4" />治。。醫生斷爲瘋症。。經將該童送入<lb n="single-5" />列度灣流行病醫院療治云。。</p></div></body></text></TEI>